<code>assert \forall int i; index<=i && i<\old(this.size()); this.get(i).equals(\old(this.get(i+1)));</code>

However, the above assertion is incorrect because it doesn't correctly reflect the requirement that elements at and after the insertion point should remain the same, except for the newly inserted element shifting them to the right. Here is the corrected version:

<code>assert \forall int i; index<i && i<\old(this.size()); this.get(i).equals(\old(this.get(i-1)));</code>
